<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#080506">
  <meta name="description" content="Eclion — El colectivo rave de música electrónica de alta intensidad en VRChat. Escenografía inmersiva, sonido sin límites y cultura underground.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="ECLION — Colectivo Rave & Experiencia Virtual VRChat">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Ritmo sin límites. Presencia real. Bajo la señal de Eclion.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="logo/IMG_1574.png">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <title>ECLION — Colectivo Rave VRChat</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="logo/IMG_1574.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="logo/IMG_1574.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500;700&family=Instrument+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Unbounded:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #060405;
      --surface: #0e090a;
      --surface-raised: #160f11;
      --surface-card: #1c1315;
      --paper: #f7f1ed;
      --muted: #a69896;
      --muted-dark: #6e6260;
      --red: #fa3529;
      --red-bright: #ff5147;
      --red-glow: rgba(250, 53, 41, 0.45);
      --red-soft: rgba(250, 53, 41, 0.12);
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --line-glow: rgba(250, 53, 41, 0.35);
      --serif: "Instrument Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
      --display: "Unbounded", "Arial Black", sans-serif;
      --mono: "DM Mono", Consolas, monospace;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--ink); color-scheme: dark; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-family: var(--serif); overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    body.menu-open, body.modal-open { overflow: hidden; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button, input, select { font: inherit; }
    button { cursor: pointer; border: none; background: transparent; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    ::selection { background: var(--red); color: #150505; }
    :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--red-bright); outline-offset: 4px; }

    /* Custom Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--ink); }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2a1b1d; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid var(--ink); }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--red); }

    /* Background noise & ambient effects */
    .bg-canvas { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; }
    .noise { position: fixed; z-index: 20; inset: 0; opacity: 0.055; pointer-events: none; background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.9'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"); }
    .orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.5; }
    .orb.one { width: 50vw; height: 50vw; top: -20vw; right: -15vw; background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--red-glow), transparent 70%); }
    .orb.two { width: 45vw; height: 45vw; bottom: 10%; left: -20vw; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(180, 20, 15, 0.35), transparent 70%); }

    /* Layout Utility */
    .shell { width: min(100% - 48px, 1340px); margin: 0 auto; }
    .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--red-bright); font: 500 11px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 22px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; }
    .section-heading { max-width: 780px; margin: 16px 0 0; font: 800 clamp(32px, 4.8vw, 68px)/1.03 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .section-heading em, .section-heading span { color: var(--red); font-style: normal; }
    .section-copy { max-width: 520px; margin: 22px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 400; }
    
    .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 54px; padding: 0 24px; border: 1px solid transparent; font: 600 11px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.3s var(--ease); position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
    .button::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent); transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease); }
    .button:hover::before { transform: translateX(100%); }
    .button:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(250,53,41,0.25); }
    .button--red { background: var(--red); color: #120405; }
    .button--red:hover { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }
    .button--line { border-color: var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); color: var(--paper); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    .button--line:hover { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red-bright); background: var(--red-soft); }
    .arrow { font-size: 15px; line-height: 0; transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease); }
    .button:hover .arrow { transform: translate(4px, -2px); }

    /* Header */
    .site-header { position: fixed; z-index: 40; inset: 0 0 auto; height: 86px; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; transition: background 0.35s var(--ease), border-color 0.35s var(--ease), backdrop-filter 0.35s var(--ease); }
    .site-header.is-scrolled { background: rgba(6, 4, 5, 0.88); border-color: var(--line); backdrop-filter: blur(24px); box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
    .header-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 100%; }
    
    .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font: 800 20px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; }
    .brand-mark-img { width: 34px; height: 34px; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px var(--red-glow)); transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease); }
    .brand:hover .brand-mark-img { transform: rotate(15deg) scale(1.1); }
    .brand-word { letter-spacing: -0.08em; }
    .brand-word i { color: var(--red); font-style: normal; }

    .nav-list { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .nav-link { position: relative; color: #cfc4c1; font: 500 11px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 6px 0; transition: color 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .nav-link::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--red); transition: width 0.25s var(--ease); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--red); }
    .nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active { color: #fff; }
    .nav-link:hover::after, .nav-link.active::after { width: 100%; }

    .header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .language-picker { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(14,9,10,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    .language-picker::after { content: "⌄"; position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 50%; color: var(--red); font: 12px/1 var(--mono); pointer-events: none; transform: translateY(-55%); }
    .language-picker select { appearance: none; border: 0; outline: 0; padding: 11px 26px 11px 12px; background: transparent; color: #fff; font: 500 10px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; cursor: pointer; }
    .language-picker option { background: #160f11; color: #fff; }
    
    .header-btn { padding: 11px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); color: #fff; font: 500 10px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.25s var(--ease); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .header-btn:hover { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red-bright); background: var(--red-soft); }

    .menu-button { display: none; width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(14,9,10,0.6); color: #fff; }
    .menu-button span { display: block; width: 18px; height: 2px; margin: 4px auto; background: currentColor; transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease), opacity 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .menu-button[aria-expanded="true"] span:first-child { transform: translateY(6px) rotate(45deg); }
    .menu-button[aria-expanded="true"] span:last-child { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg); }
    .menu-button[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }

    /* ========================================================= */
    /* HERO / HOME SECTION (Slideshow 17 images + Floating Logo) */
    /* ========================================================= */
    .hero { position: relative; display: grid; min-height: 100vh; padding: 140px 0 60px; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; align-items: center; }
    
    /* Background Slideshow Container */
    .hero-slideshow { position: absolute; z-index: -3; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1.4s ease-in-out, transform 8s linear; transform: scale(1.05); background-size: cover; background-position: center center; filter: grayscale(0.55) contrast(1.15) brightness(0.45); }
    .hero-slide.active { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    
    /* Overlay Gradients & Grid */
    .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: -2; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(8,5,6,0.2) 0%, rgba(6,4,5,0.85) 65%, #060405 100%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6,4,5,0.7) 0%, rgba(6,4,5,0.3) 40%, #060405 100%); }
    .hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: -1; inset: 0; opacity: 0.15; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 70px 70px; mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 30%, transparent 80%); }

    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
    .hero-main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    
    /* Prominent Floating Logo Card in Hero */
    .hero-logo-box { text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(14, 9, 10, 0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), inset 0 0 30px rgba(250,53,41,0.08); position: relative; animation: floatLogo 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .hero-logo-box::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -1px; left: 15%; right: 15%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--red), transparent); }
    .hero-logo-box::after { content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: -1px; left: 15%; right: 15%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--red), transparent); }
    
    @keyframes floatLogo {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(0.5deg); }
    }

    .hero-logo-img { width: min(100%, 220px); height: auto; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 25px var(--red-glow)) drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(250,53,41,0.25)); transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease); }
    .hero-logo-box:hover .hero-logo-img { transform: scale(1.06); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 35px var(--red-bright)); }
    .hero-logo-sub { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--paper); font: 700 14px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .hero-logo-tag { margin-top: 6px; color: var(--red-bright); font: 500 9px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .live-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(250,53,41,0.3); background: rgba(250,53,41,0.08); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); margin-bottom: 22px; color: var(--red-bright); font: 600 10px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .live-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--red); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--red); animation: pulseDot 1.6s infinite; }
    @keyframes pulseDot { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--red); } 50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.6; box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--red-bright); } }

    .hero-title { margin: 0; font: 900 clamp(42px, 6.8vw, 92px)/0.95 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .hero-title em { display: block; color: var(--red); font-style: normal; text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--red-glow); }
    .hero-subtitle { max-width: 560px; margin: 24px 0 0; color: #d6cbca; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 18px); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400; }
    
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px; }

    /* Live Countdown Clock */
    .countdown-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 32px; padding: 16px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(14, 9, 10, 0.65); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); width: fit-content; }
    .countdown-label { color: var(--muted); font: 500 10px/1.2 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .countdown-time { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font: 700 18px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--paper); }
    .countdown-unit { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .countdown-num { color: var(--red-bright); font-size: 20px; }
    .countdown-sub { font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; }

    .hero-bottom { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(110px, 1fr)); width: 100%; max-width: 550px; }
    .stat { padding-right: 20px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .stat + .stat { padding-left: 20px; }
    .stat:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .stat strong { display: block; font: 800 clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 36px)/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; color: #fff; }
    .stat span { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--muted); font: 500 9px/1.3 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* Ticker Banner */
    .ticker { overflow: hidden; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); background: #0a0607; }
    .ticker-track { display: flex; width: max-content; animation: crawl 28s linear infinite; }
    .ticker-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding: 16px 24px; color: #b8abaa; font: 500 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ticker-item b { color: var(--red); font-size: 14px; }
    @keyframes crawl { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

    /* ========================================================= */
    /* AUDIO PLAYER (`fondo.mp3` widget) */
    /* ========================================================= */
    .audio-widget { position: fixed; right: 24px; bottom: 24px; z-index: 50; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(250,53,41,0.4); background: rgba(10, 6, 7, 0.88); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 20px rgba(250,53,41,0.15); transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease); }
    .audio-widget:hover { border-color: var(--red); }
    
    .audio-play-btn { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--red); color: #120405; font-size: 14px; transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease), background 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .audio-play-btn:hover { background: #fff; transform: scale(1.08); }
    .audio-play-btn.is-playing { background: #fff; color: var(--red); }

    .audio-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; min-width: 140px; }
    .audio-title { color: #fff; font: 600 10px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .audio-sub { color: var(--muted); font: 400 8px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    
    /* Equalizer Bars */
    .eq-bars { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; height: 12px; }
    .eq-bar { width: 3px; background: var(--red); border-radius: 1px; height: 4px; transition: height 0.15s ease; }
    .is-playing .eq-bar:nth-child(1) { animation: eqPulse 0.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
    .is-playing .eq-bar:nth-child(2) { animation: eqPulse 0.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate 0.2s; }
    .is-playing .eq-bar:nth-child(3) { animation: eqPulse 0.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate 0.4s; }
    .is-playing .eq-bar:nth-child(4) { animation: eqPulse 0.7s ease-in-out infinite alternate 0.1s; }
    @keyframes eqPulse { 0% { height: 3px; } 100% { height: 12px; } }

    .audio-slider-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--muted); font: 500 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .audio-slider-wrap input[type=range] { width: 75px; accent-color: var(--red); cursor: pointer; height: 4px; }

    /* Autoplay Unlock Modal / Toast */
    .audio-toast { position: fixed; bottom: 85px; right: 24px; z-index: 50; padding: 12px 18px; border: 1px solid var(--red); background: rgba(22, 10, 12, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); color: var(--paper); font: 500 11px/1.4 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); animation: slideUp 0.4s var(--ease); }
    .audio-toast button { padding: 6px 12px; background: var(--red); color: #120405; font: 700 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* Toast Notification System */
    .toast-container { position: fixed; top: 100px; right: 24px; z-index: 100; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; pointer-events: none; }
    .toast-message { padding: 14px 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--red); background: rgba(18, 10, 12, 0.92); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: #fff; font: 500 11px/1.4 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); pointer-events: auto; animation: toastIn 0.3s var(--ease); }
    @keyframes toastIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }

    /* ========================================================= */
    /* SECTIONS */
    /* ========================================================= */
    section { position: relative; padding: 120px 0; scroll-margin-top: 86px; }

    /* Event Board */
    .next-event { padding: 100px 0; background: #0a0607; overflow: hidden; }
    .event-board { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(14,9,10,0.7); padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); }
    .event-board::before { content: attr(data-label); position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; padding: 10px 16px; color: #120405; background: var(--red); font: 700 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .event-board h2 { margin: 16px 0 0; font: 800 clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px)/1.04 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .event-board h2 span { color: var(--red); }
    .event-info { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 30px; }
    .event-info div { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; }
    .event-info label { display: block; color: var(--muted); font: 500 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .event-info strong { display: block; margin-top: 6px; font: 500 14px var(--serif); color: #fff; }

    /* Intro / Filosofía */
    .intro { padding: 140px 0; }
    .intro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 120px); align-items: start; }
    .intro-quote { padding: 0 0 0 30px; border-left: 2px solid var(--red); color: #ded4d1; font: 500 clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 32px)/1.35 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0; }
    .intro-quote cite { display: block; margin-top: 24px; color: var(--muted); font: 400 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-style: normal; }
    
    .principles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin-top: 70px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .principle { padding: 30px 28px 24px 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .principle + .principle { padding-left: 28px; }
    .principle:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .principle-number { color: var(--red); font: 600 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
    .principle h3 { margin: 30px 0 0; font: 700 18px var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; }
    .principle p { margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Genre Explorer */
    .genre-explorer { padding: 90px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: #0a0607; }
    .genre-explorer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(300px, 1.1fr); gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: center; }
    .genre-select { width: 100%; min-height: 54px; padding: 0 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #140d0f; color: #fff; font: 500 12px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.06em; outline: 0; transition: border-color 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .genre-select:focus { border-color: var(--red); }
    .genre-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .genre-pill { padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); color: var(--muted); font: 500 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s var(--ease); }
    .genre-pill:hover, .genre-pill.active { border-color: var(--red); color: #fff; background: var(--red-soft); }

    /* Roster */
    .roster { padding: 130px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: #080506; }
    .roster-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 32px; }
    .roster-tools { position: relative; width: min(100%, 300px); }
    .roster-tools svg { position: absolute; top: 18px; left: 16px; width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--muted); pointer-events: none; }
    .roster-search { width: 100%; padding: 16px 16px 16px 44px; border: 1px solid var(--line); outline: none; background: #120b0d; color: #fff; font: 400 12px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.06em; transition: border-color 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .roster-search::placeholder { color: #786b6a; }
    .roster-search:focus { border-color: var(--red); }
    
    .roster-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px; }
    .dj-card { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 0.82; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-card); overflow: hidden; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), border-color 0.4s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease); }
    .dj-card::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(6,4,5,0.95) 10%, rgba(6,4,5,0.1) 60%); transition: opacity 0.4s var(--ease); }
    .dj-card img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(0.7) contrast(1.1); transform: scale(1); transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease), filter 0.45s var(--ease); }
    .dj-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: var(--red); box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(250,53,41,0.2); }
    .dj-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); filter: grayscale(0) contrast(1.05); }
    
    .dj-card-content { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 20px; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; }
    .dj-card-tag { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 3px 8px; border: 1px solid var(--red); background: rgba(250,53,41,0.15); color: var(--red-bright); font: 600 8px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .dj-card h3 { margin: 0; font: 700 clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 22px)/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }
    .dj-card p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font: 400 9px/1.3 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* Media Section */
    .media-section { padding: 130px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .stream-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.75fr 1.25fr; gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 90px); align-items: center; }
    .screen { position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 10px; background: #120a0c; box-shadow: 20px 20px 0 rgba(250,53,41,0.12); }
    .screen::before { content: "LIVE / ECLIONVR"; position: absolute; z-index: 2; top: 22px; left: 22px; padding: 8px 12px; color: #fff; background: rgba(6,4,5,0.85); font: 600 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .screen a { display: block; position: relative; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #000; }
    .screen img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.85; filter: grayscale(0.3) contrast(1.1); transition: all 0.5s var(--ease); }
    .screen a:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); filter: grayscale(0); }
    .play-icon { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--red); color: #120405; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); font-size: 22px; transition: all 0.3s var(--ease); box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--red-glow); }
    .screen a:hover .play-icon { background: #fff; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.12); }

    .archive { padding: 0 0 140px; }
    .archive-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; }
    .archive-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-card); transition: all 0.35s var(--ease); overflow: hidden; }
    .archive-card:hover { border-color: var(--red); transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
    .archive-card figure { position: relative; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #000; }
    .archive-card img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.75; filter: grayscale(0.4); transition: all 0.5s var(--ease); }
    .archive-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); filter: grayscale(0); opacity: 0.95; }
    .archive-card figcaption { padding: 20px; }
    .archive-card label { color: var(--red-bright); font: 500 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .archive-card h3 { margin: 8px 0 0; font: 700 16px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; }

    /* Core Team Section */
    .people { padding: 130px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
    .people-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px; }
    .person { position: relative; min-height: 360px; padding: 28px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #0e0809; transition: border-color 0.35s var(--ease); }
    .person:hover { border-color: var(--red); }
    .person img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.4; filter: grayscale(0.8) contrast(1.15); transition: all 0.6s var(--ease); }
    .person:hover img { opacity: 0.65; transform: scale(1.06); filter: grayscale(0); }
    .person::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(0deg, #0a0607 15%, transparent 85%); }
    .person-info { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 28px; bottom: 28px; left: 28px; }
    .person-role { display: block; color: var(--red-bright); font: 600 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .person h3 { margin: 10px 0 0; font: 700 26px var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; color: #fff; }
    .person a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 16px; color: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--red); padding-bottom: 4px; font: 500 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .person a:hover { color: var(--red-bright); }

    /* Partners */
    .partners { padding: 100px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .partners-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; }
    .partner-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
    .partner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; min-width: 220px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-card); transition: all 0.3s var(--ease); }
    .partner:hover { border-color: var(--red); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .partner img { width: 40px; height: 40px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px; }
    .partner b { font: 600 12px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #fff; }
    .partner span { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--muted); font: 400 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* Footer */
    .site-footer { padding: 90px 0 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: #050304; }
    .footer-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; }
    .footer-brand .brand { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px); }
    .footer-message { max-width: 320px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 80px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted-dark); font: 500 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .footer-social { display: flex; gap: 18px; }
    .footer-social a:hover { color: var(--red); }

    /* Profile Modal Dialog */
    dialog { width: min(960px, calc(100% - 32px)); padding: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line-glow); background: #0c0708; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); }
    dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    .profile { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; min-height: 480px; }
    .profile-image { min-height: 380px; background: #160c0d; position: relative; }
    .profile-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(0.2) contrast(1.1); }
    .profile-copy { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 60px); }
    .dialog-close { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 20px; width: 40px; height: 40px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: transparent; color: #fff; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1; transition: all 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .dialog-close:hover { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red-bright); background: var(--red-soft); }
    .profile-role { color: var(--red-bright); font: 600 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .profile h2 { margin: 12px 0 0; font: 700 clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 48px)/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.06em; }
    .profile-genre { margin: 24px 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: #ded4d1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .profile-genre b { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--muted); font: 500 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .profile-description { margin: 18px 0 0; color: #c2b5b3; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .profile-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 30px; }
    .profile-link-btn { padding: 10px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--red); background: var(--red-soft); color: #fff; font: 600 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.25s var(--ease); }
    .profile-link-btn:hover { background: var(--red); color: #120405; }

    /* Reveal animations */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.8s var(--ease), transform 0.8s var(--ease); }
    .reveal.in-view { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    /* Responsive Breakpoints */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .site-header { height: 74px; }
      .nav-list { position: fixed; inset: 74px 0 auto; display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; padding: 20px 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: #0c0708; }
      .nav-list.is-open { display: flex; }
      .nav-link { display: block; padding: 14px 0; font-size: 13px; }
      .nav-link::after { display: none; }
      .menu-button { display: block; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; justify-items: center; }
      .hero-subtitle { margin-inline: auto; }
      .hero-ctas { justify-content: center; }
      .hero-logo-box { max-width: 320px; width: 100%; margin-top: 30px; }
      .countdown-bar { margin-inline: auto; }
      .hero-bottom { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
      .stat-grid { max-width: 100%; }
      .event-board, .intro-grid, .stream-layout, .genre-explorer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .roster-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .people-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .profile { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .profile-image { min-height: 240px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .shell { width: min(100% - 32px, 1340px); }
      .hero-title { font-size: clamp(36px, 11vw, 56px); }
      .button { width: 100%; }
      .roster-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .archive-grid, .people-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .audio-widget { right: 16px; bottom: 16px; left: 16px; justify-content: space-between; }
      .audio-slider-wrap { display: none; }
      .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .principle, .principle + .principle { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 24px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Ambient noise background -->
  <div class="bg-canvas" id="bgCanvas"></div>
  <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- Toast Notification Bar -->
  <div class="toast-container" id="toastContainer"></div>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="site-header" id="siteHeader">
    <div class="shell header-row">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="ECLION, Inicio">
        <img class="brand-mark-img" src="logo/IMG_1574.png" alt="ECLION Logo">
        <span class="brand-word">EC<i>LI</i>ON</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Navegación principal">
        <ul class="nav-list" id="mainNav">
          <li><a class="nav-link active" href="#top" data-i18n="navHome">Inicio</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#comunidad" data-i18n="navCommunity">Comunidad</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#roster">DJs</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#generos" data-i18n="navGenres">Géneros</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#media" data-i18n="navMedia">Media</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#equipo" data-i18n="navTeam">Equipo</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <label class="language-picker">
          <select id="languageSelect" aria-label="Seleccionar idioma">
            <option value="es">ES</option>
            <option value="en">EN</option>
            <option value="fr">FR</option>
            <option value="de">DE</option>
            <option value="pt">PT</option>
            <option value="it">IT</option>
            <option value="zh">中文</option>
            <option value="ja">日本語</option>
            <option value="ko">한국어</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button class="header-btn" id="copyGroupBtn" type="button" title="Copiar enlace VRChat">
          <span>Grupo VRChat</span> 📋
        </button>
        <a class="header-btn" href="https://discord.com/invite/ZTxBPGDVWq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span>Discord</span> ↗
        </a>
        <button class="menu-button" id="menuButton" type="button" aria-label="Abrir menú" aria-expanded="false">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <!-- ========================================================= -->
    <!-- HERO / HOME SECTION (Loop 17 imagenes + Floating Logo)    -->
    <!-- ========================================================= -->
    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <!-- 17 Background Images Slideshow -->
      <div class="hero-slideshow" id="heroSlideshow" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hero-slide active" style="background-image: url('imagenes/1.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/2.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/3.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/4.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/5.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/6.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/7.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/8.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/9.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/10.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/11.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/12.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/13.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/14.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/15.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/16.png')"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('imagenes/17.png')"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="orb one" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="shell hero-grid">
        <!-- Hero Text & Controls -->
        <div class="hero-main">
          <div class="live-badge">
            <span class="live-dot"></span>
            <span data-i18n="heroKicker">Comunidad Rave VRChat · Transmisión Activa</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="hero-title">
            <span data-i18n="heroTitleOne">El ritmo no</span>
            <em data-i18n="heroTitleTwo">tiene fronteras.</em>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-subtitle" data-i18n="heroSubtitle">
            El colectivo rave de mayor impacto en VRChat. Música electrónica de alta intensidad, escenografía virtual inmersiva y una comunidad unida por el sonido puro.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="button button--red" href="https://vrc.group/ECL.4481" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span data-i18n="joinGroup">Unirse al Grupo VRChat</span> <span class="arrow">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a class="button button--line" href="#roster">
              <span data-i18n="meetRoster">Explorar Roster DJs</span> <span class="arrow">↓</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Saturday Countdown Timer -->
          <div class="countdown-bar">
            <div class="countdown-label" data-i18n="nextSaturday">Próximo Pulso Sábado:</div>
            <div class="countdown-time" id="countdownClock">
              <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="countdown-num" id="cdDays">00</span><span class="countdown-sub">Días</span></div>:
              <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="countdown-num" id="cdHours">00</span><span class="countdown-sub">Hrs</span></div>:
              <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="countdown-num" id="cdMins">00</span><span class="countdown-sub">Min</span></div>:
              <div class="countdown-unit"><span class="countdown-num" id="cdSecs">00</span><span class="countdown-sub">Seg</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Official Logo Overlay -->
        <div class="hero-logo-box">
          <img class="hero-logo-img" src="logo/IMG_1574.png" alt="Logo Oficial Eclion">
          <div class="hero-logo-sub">ECLION</div>
          <div class="hero-logo-tag" data-i18n="officialMark">SEÑAL UNDERGROUND · VRCHAT</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Bottom Stats -->
      <div class="shell hero-bottom">
        <div class="stat-grid">
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>23</strong>
            <span data-i18n="residentDjs">DJs Residentes</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>63+</strong>
            <span data-i18n="videosLives">Sesiones & Directos</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>2.450+</strong>
            <span data-i18n="activeMembers">Miembros Activos</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Genre Ticker Bar -->
    <div class="ticker" aria-label="Géneros musicales">
      <div class="ticker-track">
        <div class="ticker-item">
          <b>✦</b> HARD TECHNO <b>✦</b> FRENCHCORE <b>✦</b> GABBER <b>✦</b> BREAKCORE <b>✦</b> DRUM & BASS <b>✦</b> INDUSTRIAL <b>✦</b> SCHRANZ <b>✦</b> UPTEMPO <b>✦</b> HARDSTYLE <b>✦</b> TEKNO <b>✦</b> HARD TECHNO <b>✦</b> FRENCHCORE <b>✦</b> GABBER <b>✦</b> BREAKCORE <b>✦</b> DRUM & BASS <b>✦</b> INDUSTRIAL
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Próxima Transmisión -->
    <section class="next-event" id="eventos">
      <div class="shell event-board reveal" data-label="PRÓXIMO PULSO" data-i18n-data-label="nextTransmission">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="eclionCalendar">Calendario Oficial</p>
          <h2 id="event-title"><span data-i18n="nextPulseOne">La energía arranca</span> <span data-i18n="nextPulseTwo">este Sábado.</span></h2>
          <div class="event-info">
            <div>
              <label data-i18n="frequency">Frecuencia</label>
              <strong data-i18n="everySaturday">Todos los Sábados · 22:00 CET</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label data-i18n="location">Ubicación Virtual</label>
              <strong data-i18n="vrchatInstance">Instancia Privada VRChat</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="event-actions">
          <a class="button button--red" href="https://discord.com/invite/ZTxBPGDVWq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span data-i18n="upcomingEvents">Confirmar Asistencia en Discord</span> <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Comunidad / Filosofía -->
    <section class="intro" id="comunidad">
      <div class="orb two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="intro-grid">
          <div class="reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="ourFrequency">Nuestra Frecuencia</p>
            <h2 class="section-heading" data-i18n="moreThanEvent">Más que un evento. <em>Una cultura.</em></h2>
            <p class="section-copy" data-i18n="communityCopy">
              Eclion nace para dar a la escena hard un espacio auténtico, vanguardista y sin concesiones en VRChat: sonido atronador, visuales reactivos y una comunidad apasionada.
            </p>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="intro-quote reveal">
            <span data-i18n="communityQuote">“No se trata solo de escuchar una sesión. Se trata de adentrarte en el mundo virtual, conectar con tu gente y dejar que los BPM marquen el latido de la noche.”</span>
            <cite data-i18n="communityCite">ECLION / Colectivo Rave VRChat</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="principles reveal">
          <article class="principle">
            <span class="principle-number">01 / ESCENOGRAFÍA</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="principleOneTitle">ATMÓSFERA IMMERSIVA</h3>
            <p data-i18n="principleOneCopy">Mundos VRChat diseñados a medida con iluminación audioreactiva y sonido espacial que transforman cada set en una vivencia física.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="principle">
            <span class="principle-number">02 / SONIDO</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="principleTwoTitle">SIN LÍMITES DE BPM</h3>
            <p data-i18n="principleTwoCopy">Desde la contundencia del industrial techno y hardstyle hasta la velocidad pura del frenchcore, uptempo y breakcore.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="principle">
            <span class="principle-number">03 / UNIÓN</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="principleThreeTitle">COMUNIDAD SOBERANA</h3>
            <p data-i18n="principleThreeCopy">Espacio abierto e inclusivo que conecta a ravers e hispanohablantes de todo el mundo bajo una misma señal.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
